      en: ["Denu serves as the administrative capital of the Ketu South Municipal District.", "The town is located only about 5 kilometers west of the border with Togo and Lome.", "Salt production from the Keta Lagoon is a mainstay of the local economy.", "Denu is widely recognized for its extensive coconut-growing industry.", "The town is a significant transit point for travelers heading to Benin and Nigeria.", "Coastal sea defense projects have been implemented to protect Denu from erosion."],
